------------------------------------------------------------
PARITY MAPPING (web -> native; honesty covenant #2/#5 — no scope narrowing)
------------------------------------------------------------
Data sources (web hooks -> one P1/S8 seam `VehiclePhotoStore`, view does NO HTTP):
  useVehiclePhoto        -> store.onUpdate snapshot (has_photo + uploaded_at + photoURL + loading/error)
  useUploadVehiclePhoto  -> store.upload(PickedPhoto) async throws -> VehiclePhotoMeta
  useDeleteVehiclePhoto  -> store.delete() async throws
  useToast               -> model.toast (VehiclePhotoToast: success/danger) + .task(id:) auto-dismiss
  useTranslation         -> VehiclePhotoStrings facade (NSLocalizedString, web `t(key, default)` fallbacks)

Shared components (web -> native, no direct library imports):
  GlassPanel    -> TSGlassPanel          Spinner -> ProgressView/TSSkeleton
  Button        -> TSButton              Toast   -> VehiclePhotoToastView (Chrome)
  ConfirmDialog -> .confirmationDialog (destructive role) — Apple-idiomatic, per ActiveSessionsSection precedent
  Charts/Maps   -> none used by this surface (web source has none)

File selection (web hidden <input type=file> + drag/drop) -> SwiftUI `.fileImporter`
  (allowedContentTypes [.jpeg,.png]) + `.dropDestination(for: URL.self)`; bytes read via a
  security-scoped resource, MIME derived from the extension; preview via AsyncImage
  (current photo) or a cross-platform Image(data:) (in-flight pick).

States — every one renders (no hidden surface; honesty covenant #2):
  loading (skeleton dropzone) · error (QueryError peer + Retry) · content-no-photo
  (friendly drop prompt, never blank) · content-has-photo (preview + Replace + Remove) ·
  uploading (preview + "Uploading…" disabled button) · stale/offline (freshness chip +
  banner + one-shot auto-refresh on the stale transition).

i18n keys: 32 keys referenced in code == 32 keys in the catalog (0 missing, 0 orphan).
  All 14 web-source strings present (title, confirm title/message, 4 toast results,
  previewAlt, dropPrompt, constraints {{max}}, uploading, replace, choose, remove, Remove).

